==Self-inflicted lethal damage==
{{Main|Hitpoints#Self-inflicted damage}}
Players looking to take lethal damage in game can use several in game items and various pieces of scenery to control the location of a gravestone or clear themselves of a particular status effect.

===Items===
*[[Araxyte venom sac]]
*[[Enchanted symbol]]
*[[Strange device]]
*[[Lit strange object]]
*[[Sea slug (item)]]

===Scenery===
*Picking [[Nettles (scenery)|nettles]] without wearing gloves
*Picking up a [[Kharid Scorpion]] without the [[scorpion cage]]
*Triggering various [[Thieving]] traps
*Failing [[Agility]] shortcuts/obstacles
*Taking from a [[rat trap]]
*Taking from a [[beehive]] without protective equipment


